1
00:00:00,722 --> 00:00:02,522
(Mrs Davis:)you'll be able to choose

2
00:00:02,524 --> 00:00:04,254
(Mrs Davis:)whatever field of research
you'd like.

3
00:00:05,627 --> 00:00:09,567
(Sheldon:)But if I'm a professor,
then I'll have to teach a class.

4
00:00:09,564 --> 00:00:10,934
(Mrs Davis:)That is correct.

5
00:00:12,400 --> 00:00:17,100
(Sheldon:)So your solution is to
promote me and pay me more money

6
00:00:17,105 --> 00:00:19,005
(Sheldon:)so that I can impart
my knowledge

7
00:00:19,007 --> 00:00:20,977
(Sheldon:)to the next generation
of scientists?

8
00:00:20,975 --> 00:00:22,205
(Howard:)Yes.

9
00:00:23,611 --> 00:00:25,581
(Sheldon:)You people are sick.

10
00:00:29,184 --> 00:00:30,754
(knocks)
PENNY: Hey.

11
00:00:30,752 --> 00:00:32,152
(Penny:)Ready to go to lunch?

12
00:00:32,153 --> 00:00:33,483
(Amy:)Just give me a minute.

13
00:00:33,488 --> 00:00:34,858
(Amy:)I'm stimulating the pleasure
cells of this starfish.

14
00:00:34,856 --> 00:00:36,056
(Amy:)I just need to turn it off.

15
00:00:36,057 --> 00:00:37,987
(Penny:)What happens
if you don't?

16
00:00:37,992 --> 00:00:39,422
(Amy:)Then I have to sit through lunch

17
00:00:39,427 --> 00:00:41,957
(Amy:)knowing this starfish is
having a better day than I am.

18
00:00:43,198 --> 00:00:45,528
(Amy:)Is Bernadette meeting us
at the restaurant?

19
00:00:45,533 --> 00:00:48,473
(Penny:)Uh, no. Actually,
I didn't invite her.

20
00:00:48,470 --> 00:00:49,740
(Amy:)How come?

21
00:00:49,738 --> 00:00:51,808
(Penny:)Well, ever since she helped me
get this job,

22
00:00:51,806 --> 00:00:53,306
(Penny:)she won't stop bugging me.

23
00:00:53,308 --> 00:00:55,808
(Amy:)Well, I think she just wants you
to do well,

24
00:00:55,810 --> 00:00:57,240
(Amy:)and she's worried that you won't

25
00:00:57,245 --> 00:01:01,585
(Amy:)'cause you were just
a stunningly poor waitress.

